Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:40.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(埃尔伍德  印第安纳州)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第6季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(禁止进入  地区演习指挥部命令  2014年8月1日  堪萨斯城  命令号:84834343QE)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(警告!危险!  请勿入内  剧毒物质)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到萨姆会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect Sam to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在他走进这个门的那一刻  我就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the minute he walked through that door, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点儿不对劲  我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something wrong with me. I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不见了  -那会在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's gone. - So, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还在封印米迦勒和路西法的牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still in the cage with Michael and Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那就把它弄回来啊  -那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then, just get it back. - That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:20.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经丧失了本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got no instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真是有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you are seriously messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚你是什么  反正不是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you are 'cause you're not Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装蒜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你说得没错  -哪方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were right. - About?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实不是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我压根就不是真的在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I don't even really care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是我是该觉得内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe I should feel guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.85,0:01:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西在玉米地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something out in the corn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克  你吓着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick, you're freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就去看一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just having a quick look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:43.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.29,0:01:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:33.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:24.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要说  我相信印第安纳州的埃尔伍德  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I believe that Elwood, Indiana,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已然成为了外星人的活动集中地\N{\fnArial\fs30}has become a center of extraterrestrial activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时一道光闪过  接着帕特里克就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this light, and then Patrick just vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all happening, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些实体会帮助人类进入到新的阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, these entities have come to help push humanity to the next stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小韦恩·惠特克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Wayne Whitaker, Jr.,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己录下了许多的目击实录\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have personally recorded dozens of eyewitness accounts 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中都提到了天空中的奇怪光束\N{\fnArial\fs30}strange lights in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不明生物试图与目击者交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}mysterious presences attempting contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从这事儿闹的满城风雨之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since this whole damn circus has blown into town,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没人关心有四个人失踪了  束手无策\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one seems to realize we've got four missing-persons cases, wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友们失去了至亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends lost loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么了  有东西抓走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him? Something took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按我们圈内人的说法  我们卷入了"飞碟门"\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are right in the middle of what we in the field like to call a "U.F.O. Flap,"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此刻的我无比激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am as happy as a pig in shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保证这绝对不是飞碟作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can guarantee you this has nothing to do with U.F.O.S
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟什么外星人之类的半毛钱关系都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}or little green men or anything extraterrestrial whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然不是什么飞碟啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's not U.F.O.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是精灵才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  谢谢您的高见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, thank you for your input.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  光是飞碟您觉得还不够疯狂么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, flying saucers not insane enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪家报社的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What newspaper did you say you work for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是想添油加醋自嗨一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you want to add glitter to that glue you're sniffing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你  但是别跟我们这儿发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine, but don't dump your wackadoo all over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.15,0:04:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们可不想掺和进来  -好了  我们问完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'd rather not step in it. - Okay, we -- we -- we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你丢的不过就是一些小猫  大姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing you're missing is a couple dozen cats, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他血糖高容易激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's -- it's a blood-sugar thing. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.37,0:04:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-干嘛  -干嘛  你还敢问\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - "What?"  You gotta ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  没错  你确实得问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yes. You do have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  但这简直就是搞笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry, but this is all a big joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会真要查什么飞碟吧  太扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're not actually taking this U.F.O. crap seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  外星人那些都是假的  地球人都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. E.T. is made of rubber. Everybody knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那4个人确确实实是失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are four legitimate vanishings in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  萨姆  顺便说一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Sam, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被谣言所骗又不是那位女士的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not the lady's fault she took the brown acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:57.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:04:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,共情  老弟  共情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empathy, man. Empathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的萨姆会用泪汪汪的狗狗眼看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the old Sam would've given her some-some wussified, dew-eyed crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为以前的萨姆有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old Sam had a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人性  随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a soul. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错  但你现在没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yes. And -- and -- and -- but you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是没人性  随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or aren't. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  -行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你都不在乎  -那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't care. - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须得在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟该在乎什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周遭的一切  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}About everything, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少  你得有点人性吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-about being human, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你显然是相当在乎  那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, you obviously care. A lot. And that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  但我不在乎的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But -- but I can't care about what --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不在乎  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I can't care about, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我怎么办呢  假装吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do, fake it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  就是那样  假装一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Absolutely. Fake it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假装到你真得在乎为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake it till you make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要我事事坦诚的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you wanting me to be all honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想成为真人的话  皮诺曹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to be a real boy, pinocchio,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就必须得有点儿人样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to act the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前就在假装  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was faking it, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从咱俩重新一起猎魔开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since we got back on the road together,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说句话都得斟酌半天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was picking every frickin' word!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-累死我了  -好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's exhausting! - Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在找回你的灵魂之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until we get you back on the soul train,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来当你的良心  行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be your conscience, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是说你是我的  杰米尼·克力克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying you'll be my...Jiminy Cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:58.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  没错  你个该死的木偶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, you freakin' puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布伦南先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brennan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是《镜报》的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with the Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们是想来问问你  -问什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'd just like to ask you -- what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:26.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想问帕特里克的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.13,0:06:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失踪了  没错  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing. Right, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是想跟你谈这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's what we want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子是第一个失踪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, your son was the first to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一个被带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}First to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布伦南先生  你觉得谁把你儿子带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brennan, who do you believe took your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们帮不了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子永远都回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boy is never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听上去你似乎很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound awfully sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:06:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎你明明知道却故意隐瞒着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you know something you're not talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,72小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间一过  找回失踪之人的几率就几乎为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, the odds of finding a missing person drop to nothing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  事事总有不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, every case is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经好几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你想到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call us...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if anything comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:27.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:50.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留下来看着这个钟表匠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stay and watch watchmaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看夜幕降临之后他会不会有所行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what happens when the sun goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去看看那片麦田怪圈  -好滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go check out the crop circles. - Okeydokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不许以任何形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do not engage with, maim,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤害或者杀害布伦南\N{\fnArial\fs30}or in any way kill Brennan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  所有事你都不许自己擅自做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I don't want you making any judgment calls whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有情况  就打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything happens, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.31,0:08:09.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了  杰米尼  我一整年都是自己猎魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Jiminy, I was on my own for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有你  我也做得挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did fine without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:14.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你定义的"好"  我不敢恭维\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to know your definition of "Fine."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他唯一的行动就是各种酗酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only thing this guy's up to is alcoholism.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我应该再去找他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe I should go talk to him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:09:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你说他对我们有所隐瞒的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're the one who said he's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh, shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你看见什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-飞碟  有飞碟  -哥们  别叫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- U.F.O.! U.F.O.!   - Whoa. Dude, stop yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信号不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're breaking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.26,0:09:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一句我没听清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't catch that last part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接触  接触啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close encounter! Close encounter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close encounter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪一类的  第一还是第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind? First, second?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在追我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经是第三类了啊  你最好快点跑  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third kind already? You better run, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第四类好像就是爆菊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the fourth kind is a butt thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,共情啊  萨姆  共情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empathy, Sam! Empathy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还追着你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:02.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说  真的是有飞碟咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, they're real. U.F.O.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我之前说过的  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said before, son --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真相就在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You're the expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:50.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么才能抓到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I get 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你捕获外星人  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you hunt E.T.S, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道怎么才能捉住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know how to get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩同病相怜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说  三十年的目击实录足以说明问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd say that 30 years of eyewitness accounts
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是难以争辩的铁证\N{\fnArial\fs30}speak for themselves, as incontrovertible proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother was abducted,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于证据什么的我毫不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm pretty good on the whole proof part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥被绑架了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother was abducted?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我的天哪  -没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my god. - It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有充足的时间来适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've had time to adjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是不是在你们小时候被绑走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it -- did it happen when you were kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  大概就半小时之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Like half an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.47,0:12:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说你追捕飞碟都有三十年之久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've been hunting U.F.O.S for over three decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你手头上却没有具体数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you basically have no concrete data
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有可用的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}and zero workable leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.31,0:12:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这个...  -你知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I   - Have you considered the possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在追捕飞碟这一行  真不咋地\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you suck at hunting U.F.O.S?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.69,0:12:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽我所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:33.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外星人把你哥哥送回来了诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought your brother back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解  你得多陪陪你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I so totally understand you need time as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们到底什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were they like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们个个都是牛逼闪闪又贪婪的二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were grabby, incandescent douchebags.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:13:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-河蟹  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Too soon.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却在和个"广罗香"瞎搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were banging patchouli.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没那么难闻吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think she smelled that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我被外星人绑架了  - 我有去调查啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was abducted by aliens!  - I was looking into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.55,0:14:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调查毛  我只不过消失了差不多一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking into it?! I was gone for like an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一小时  -大部分时间还浪费在走路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An hour?  - And most of that was walking back to town!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我猜你的表肯定停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I think your watch is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都失踪了一个晚上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been gone all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你胡扯什么  我才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凌晨四点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}4:00 A.M.?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞碟可以穿越时空\N{\fnArial\fs30}U.F.O. Time-slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:46.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和很多被绑故事里说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That actually falls in line with a lot of abduction stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Falls in line"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一样个毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's falling in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.91,0:15:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.35,0:15:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是...这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.21,0:15:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help me, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有道很亮的白光\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this bright white light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就突然  我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then -- and suddenly, I was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就到了另一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I w-- I was in a different place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有些  生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there were these...beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们都太亮了  晃得我都不敢看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they -- they were -- they were too bright to look at,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我能感觉的到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I-I could feel them...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们把我拉向一张桌子似的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}pulling me towards this sort of...table.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-探测桌  -天哪  别说那么大声\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Probing table! - God, don't say that out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都做了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went...crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始到处乱踢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started hacking and --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乱砍  开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and slashing and firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.19,0:16:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看起来有些惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They -- they actually seemed surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想从来没人这样干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't think anybody's ever done that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和外星人亲密接触了一把  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a close encounter, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.45,0:16:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该去冲个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是该去冲澡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去  要去冲澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna -- I'm gonna take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  除了恶魔  天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, on top of all the demons and the angels
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那些鬼魂和剥皮行者之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the ghosts and the skinwalkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}it turns out that there's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.13,0:16:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说  如果真有外星人  \N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if aliens are actually real, 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那接下来还会有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's next, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,霍比特人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbits?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.85,0:16:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚给她使了个"怎么样"的眼色\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gave her the silent "How you doin'."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对真实世界的认知正在被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our reality's collapsing around us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:16:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然还有心情勾搭女招待\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're trying to pick up our waitress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that brings up a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假设你有灵魂  你在调查一件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, say you got a soul, and you're on a case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你哥哥被外星人绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your brother gets abducted by aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  那你就要尽一切可能把他找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, then you do everything you can to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你是尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  如果那天晚上基本没有线索呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about when there are no more leads for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  如果你已经无能为力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, are you supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就该\N{\fnArial\fs30}just sit there in the dark and suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个人孤坐在黑暗中忍受煎熬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}even when there's nothing that can be done at that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:22.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没错  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得孤坐在黑暗中  感受你失去了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sit in the dark, and you -- you feel the loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我就不能一边做到你说的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But -- but couldn't I just do all that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一边和个嬉皮小妞发生关系么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have sex with the hippie chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正都是在黑暗中啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:37.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行  因为你应该痛苦万分才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you couldn't, because you would be suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能一到晚上就把这事抛诸脑后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can't just turn that off for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为啥不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果你有灵魂的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you had a soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂不会让你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}your soul wouldn't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有灵魂等于忍受煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a soul equals suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's exactly what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给莉莎打了无数个电话一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}the million times you almost called Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你是说忍受煎熬是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying suffering is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你没的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying it's the only game in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我们该怎么对付那些小绿人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we deal with the little green men?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从调查开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Research.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要补习一个世纪的飞碟知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got about a century of UFO lore to catch up on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可没有时间再...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's no time for --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:30.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窗户旁边那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy by the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盯着我的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving me the stink eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说那个条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not the cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙  就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy! He's right --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-咱赶紧走了行不  -你犯啥毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we please just get out of here? - What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别逼我打你  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Before I hit you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,图书馆要关门了  我也差不多搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Library's closing up soon. I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找着什么没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是找得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.59,0:18:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地球上几乎所有人都相信有飞碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone on the planet believes in UFOs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们会不停地写这方面的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will not stop writing books about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.06,0:19:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好歹书上还是有标点符号的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, at least books have punctuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.14,0:19:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你接着查\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你回来我们再研究你都找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see what you got when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:26.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有乳头耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nipples?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个小婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看什么  看这血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-s-see what? See see t -- the -- the blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这里恶心得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}See all the -- the -- the blech!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  伙计  我啥也没看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, man. I'm not seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.71,0:20:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么恶心你居然看不到  就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't see the -- the echh?! It's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  也就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go with
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:40.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看得到  但我看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see it and I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是啥玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.19,0:20:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个迷你的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裸女  行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naked lady, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a... a what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:21:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个迷你发光性感裸女  还带乳头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was -- it was a little, glowing, hot, naked lady with nipples.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还打了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.90,0:21:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不该笑  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to laugh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  当然  必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说...刚才那场暗夜惊魂的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...So, shot in the dark here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.67,0:21:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到这位迷你裸女有翅膀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but did this...little lady have wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为啥这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell made you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有  对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:23.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是你  你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but how -- how did you --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查到的其中一个诡异的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the fringier theories I came across.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和那个拿水晶的老疯婆唠叨的东西一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's actually what crazy crystal lady was yammering about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这些绑架根本和飞碟无关呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if these abductions have nothing to do with UFOs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -好吧  假设几个世纪以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Okay, say these encounters
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直出现的这种状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been going on for centuries --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是什么外星人造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not with extraterrestrials
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是由于某种地球以外的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with ultra-terrestrials.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.37,0:21:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  现在人们都管这叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, people nowadays say 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.83,0:21:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么外星人之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}space aliens or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是以前人们都管这叫...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they used to call them...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.69,0:21:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-蓝精灵  -是小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smurfs? - Fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小精灵  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairies? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  外星人和小精灵是有直接联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there's a straight line between ETs and fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都会发光  都要绑架人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glowing lights, abductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不同包装下  同样的飞碟事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's all the same UFO stuff just under a different skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得飞碟的谜底就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seriously think the secret with the UFOs is --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:21:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你把小仙女叮叮铃当披萨给烤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're the one who pizza-rolled tinker bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是帮你解释而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just doing the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这也挺好的  起码是一条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is good. This is a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.69,0:22:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lead where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.61,0:22:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:12.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小仙女和小宝藏守护者  小幻形怪和小棕仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sprites and spriggans, boggarts and brownies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些小东西有很多名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little people have many names.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  就是这个迷你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's -- that's the little...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之  我明白了这位小仙女叮叮铃就是小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I, uh, I-I get that tinker bells are fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  那小小圣诞老人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, what about the tiny Santa Claus
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.17,0:22:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有巨魔  还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the troll and the --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是花园矮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, that's a garden gnome,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外那个是大个儿地精\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a large goblin,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.40,0:22:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些  这些都是小精灵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that -- but they're all fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.29,0:22:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小精灵们形态各异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairy comes in many shapes and sizes --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自其他国度  会魔法又顽皮捣蛋的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magical, mischievous beings from the realm next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.44,0:22:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小精灵王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fairy realm? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像那种其他维度的空间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's like another dimension?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一个世界  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another reality, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.99,0:22:55.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有那些去到过那里又回到这个世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only people who have been there and returned to our world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.65,0:22:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能在这里看到小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}can see the fairy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.69,0:22:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小精灵为什么要绑架人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are the fairies abducting people?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对此有很多种解释  但很少有接近事实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there is much theory and little fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道他们只会抓走家里的大儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know they only take first-born sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像侏儒怪一样(德国传说)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like rumpelstiltskin did!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  他们可能被带到阿瓦隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I think they're taken to Avalon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去服侍欧泊龙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to service Oberon,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.81,0:23:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是精灵之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}king of the fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服侍过那个精灵之王欧泊龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}service Oberon, king of the fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.96,0:23:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marion...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.79,0:23:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真的有精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say fairies are real, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们能怎么做  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What can we do about them? - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how can we...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.79,0:23:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他们交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interact with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.77,0:23:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴力的交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forcefully interact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.06,0:23:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想找精灵帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you want to win a fairy's favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.63,0:23:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得送他们一碗新鲜奶油\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave a bowl of fresh cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.93,0:23:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们爱死奶油了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They love cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.16,0:24:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.28,0:24:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有更暴力点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, and -- and more forcefully?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.82,0:24:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精灵都不喜欢铁器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all fairy hate iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而黑暗精灵接会被银器灼伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the dark fairy burn when touched with silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.34,0:24:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.19,0:24:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你在精灵面前撒上糖或盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could spill sugar or salt in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.25,0:24:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论他们有多强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.23,0:24:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都必须弯腰去数颗粒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fairy must stoop to count each grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.65,0:24:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.53,0:24:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.06,0:24:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot to absorb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.94,0:24:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:35.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.69,0:24:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把茶喝完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish your tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.68,0:24:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.19,0:24:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大爱这里的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I love the feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.37,0:24:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像  就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, it's -- it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.09,0:24:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像袖珍版的亚利桑那州的赛多纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like Sedona, Arizona, crapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之极富质感\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Pewter-iffic is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.60,0:24:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真质感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pewter-iffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有大点的杯子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have bigger cups?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.15,0:25:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我被附身了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, is it on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.95,0:25:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我感觉被那玩意附身了  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel like I've got the crazy on me. - No, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.63,0:25:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你确实被精灵劫持过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did sit in some glitter, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.38,0:25:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不如相信被飞碟劫持了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just makes me want to believe in UFOs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.02,0:25:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说  你这些想法对行动可没帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't really give us a next move. I'll grant you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事应该打电话问鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can always put the call out to Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞笑了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.00,0:25:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是那个钟表匠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the watch guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.72,0:25:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱死奶油哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They love cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.71,0:25:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(布伦南钟表行)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.88,0:26:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟着他去酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you stick with half and half.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.09,0:26:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去他店里看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check out his store.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.09,0:26:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准勾引小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no hippie chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.54,0:27:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.05,0:27:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里到处都是精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friggin' full of keeblers over here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.58,0:27:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满屋子都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just full of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.62,0:27:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -就像故事里讲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's like -- it's like the story
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.99,0:27:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修鞋匠养着一群精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the -- with the shoe guy and all the elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说布伦南会不会跟精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you -- you think Brennan made a deal
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.09,0:27:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a bunch of fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:27:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.93,0:28:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  布伦南先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Brennan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.47,0:28:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.35,0:28:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.41,0:28:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有说过你手工很好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I ever mention how beautiful your work is?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.56,0:28:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.16,0:28:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表做的极好极好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The watches -- just stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.44,0:28:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我很疑惑的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I can't figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.43,0:28:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人是怎么做出这么多表的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is how one man can put out that much product.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  别人不知道的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, if I didn't know better,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还以为你有一群精灵帮你干活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say you have a bunch of elves working for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.15,0:28:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except I do know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.51,0:28:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实有一群精灵帮你干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have a bunch of elves working for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.80,0:28:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.19,0:28:46.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  什么样的父亲会狠心用亲生儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me -- how does a father decide to trade his son
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.72,0:28:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交换一堆钟表\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a bunch of watches?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.70,0:28:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你还是有灵魂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm assuming you have a soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.89,0:28:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你到底是为了什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what's your excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.74,0:28:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不是这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.02,0:29:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:40.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠做这些钟表养家糊口三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I supported my family for 30 years making those watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.00,0:29:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我唯一会做的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing I know how to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但得了帕金森症后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Parkinson's...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法控制住双手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was losing my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.55,0:29:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将失去一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was losing everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.94,0:29:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶常说世上真的有精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother, she always used to say that they were real,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.83,0:30:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我小的时候她教过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told me all these stories when I was a kid
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.43,0:30:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何召唤精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how to summon them,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.23,0:30:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何得到精灵的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to get favors from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.34,0:30:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你会施咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you learned how to work a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.87,0:30:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.55,0:30:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来我都不知道行不行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I doubted it would even work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我太绝望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她留了一本书给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left me this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.51,0:30:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个月前我就在店里进行了召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I did the ceremony in my back office two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.84,0:30:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  出现了一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this...man appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.98,0:30:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自称是小妖精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was a leprechaun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.09,0:30:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小妖精\N{\fnArial\fs30}A leprechaun?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.52,0:30:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我请求他治好我的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked him just to cure my hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.91,0:30:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他说他可以做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he said he would do even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.07,0:30:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可以帮我达到前所未有的高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd make me more successful than I'd ever been.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.57,0:30:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说可以送我几个工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me he'd bring a crew of workers,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.35,0:30:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以挽救我的事业和名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I could save my business, save my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.91,0:30:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件是\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for...?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.35,0:30:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件是给他们提供休息住所\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just wanted a place for them to rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.09,0:30:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以享受这片沃土的滋润\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To take of the fruit and fat of the land."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.25,0:30:57.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.43,0:30:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.10,0:31:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.76,0:31:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沃土的滋润是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the "Fruit and the fat" Was...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.04,0:31:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的大儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first-born.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.83,0:31:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不光是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not just mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.13,0:31:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been others.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.94,0:31:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们贪婪不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.97,0:31:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不打算收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not going to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.63,0:31:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有法子破除咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a way to reverse the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.89,0:31:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.51,0:31:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the book is...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.77,0:31:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放在我店里保险柜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the safe in my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.16,0:31:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们根本不让我靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't let me near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.42,0:31:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就像是一场噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.32,0:31:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能看得见精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can see the fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.74,0:32:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救命  -抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.87,0:32:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓到你了  你个小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, you little fairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.63,0:32:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们精灵有什么阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, you fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.35,0:32:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我要杀光你们精灵  -救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll kill you, you fairy! - Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.64,0:32:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说啊  精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk, fairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.86,0:32:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  悲剧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.25,0:32:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.89,0:33:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  别担心  布伦南\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now, don't worry, Brennan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.98,0:33:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.29,0:33:06.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你破除咒语的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, my brother and I are gonna cover you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.47,0:33:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和我哥会保护你  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you reverse the ritual, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.47,0:33:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Hey, dude! What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.70,0:33:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.25,0:33:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.53,0:33:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该咋办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.58,0:33:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收拾那些精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight the fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.88,0:33:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去收拾那些精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight those fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.71,0:33:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收拾了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight the fairies!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.23,0:33:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.66,0:33:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是为啥要进行这种仇恨犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what kind of hate crime this even was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.79,0:33:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是仇恨犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a hate crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.33,0:33:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那位先生是个彻彻底底的同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if this gentlemen were a full-sized homosexual,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.29,0:33:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.64,0:33:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得能接受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that be okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:49.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不仇恨任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hate any-size person
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.24,0:33:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是  任何  同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or -- or -- or any-size gay guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.77,0:33:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是同性恋  哪有那么巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not gay, as it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.97,0:33:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他是蒂普顿县的地方检察官\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is the district attorney for tipton county.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.77,0:34:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常严厉的人哦  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Runs a tight ship, tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.96,0:34:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴听说他这么兢兢业业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's nice to hear he's done so well for himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.55,0:34:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering his, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.78,0:34:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟现在...经济不景气啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Considering the tough economic times.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.18,0:34:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:13.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.57,0:34:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...You are all kinds of messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.65,0:34:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.73,0:34:44.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在  但没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.51,0:34:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶油把它们都放倒了  就像龙舌兰酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cream hits them like tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.93,0:35:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.38,0:35:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.36,0:35:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.20,0:35:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.10,0:35:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.83,0:35:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那妖精\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the leprechaun?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.55,0:35:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.45,0:35:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉弄脏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about the mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.37,0:35:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your friend here, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.02,0:35:41.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完成他的交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went back on his deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.47,0:35:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你没跟他说清楚交易筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you weren't very clear with him on the terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.03,0:35:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过他  会有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him there was a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.02,0:35:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一旦来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we come,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.12,0:35:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就再也不走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We come to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.58,0:35:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们抓走了大儿子  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you take first-borns, and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.34,0:35:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就在一旁看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just sit back and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.36,0:35:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们用一堆飞碟之类的废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}While they cover up the abductions for you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.03,0:36:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮你掩盖绑架的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all that crazy U.F.O. Crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.31,0:36:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  都是你怂恿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you help encourage, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.01,0:36:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美的骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice con.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.84,0:36:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你的骗局被揭穿了  韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your cover's blown now, Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.48,0:36:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,揭穿  被谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Blown"? To whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.67,0:36:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布伦南已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brennan's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.73,0:36:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.13,0:36:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去过我们的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.47,0:36:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经被做了标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been to the ranch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.21,0:36:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他现在是我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.97,0:36:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.28,0:36:26.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.09,0:36:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.80,0:36:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你看见我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can only see me...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.37,0:36:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才能看见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.15,0:36:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.50,0:36:37.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你终究得靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll have to get near me eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.00,0:36:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我反应很快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have very good reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.19,0:36:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和他们不一样  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not like the rest of them, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.03,0:36:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.22,0:36:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I could see that right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.02,0:36:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你缺了一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're missing a certain piece,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.56,0:36:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在中心那里  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in the center, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.49,0:36:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.20,0:37:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们精灵对能量最为敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we fairy folk are all about energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.73,0:37:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的灵魂有一种特殊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the human soul gives off a certain
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.08,0:37:06.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,香味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.98,0:37:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂很遥远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soul is far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.23,0:37:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但并非遥不可及\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not completely out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.39,0:37:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.10,0:37:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.88,0:37:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get it back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.18,0:37:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但要做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.34,0:37:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.08,0:37:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它被锁在一个恶魔的盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked in a box with the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.30,0:37:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你们来说是恶魔  对我们来说不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your devil, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.21,0:37:28.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使都做不到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no freakin' way
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.13,0:37:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖精是不可能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A leprechaun can do what angels cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.93,0:37:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使  算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels. Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.94,0:37:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在说真正的魔法  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about real magic, sonny,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.58,0:37:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我族这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}From my side of the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.12,0:37:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到一条密径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a way of gettin' in back doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.37,0:37:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来  你是我的蓝精灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're my blue fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.59,0:37:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把我变回完整的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make me a real boy again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.63,0:37:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你许个愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you wish upon a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.11,0:37:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.66,0:37:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.43,0:38:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.85,0:38:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Painful...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.61,0:38:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不是什么大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not a deal breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.08,0:39:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧  小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.94,0:39:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经打过最有把握的一枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already taken your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.16,0:39:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.23,0:39:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.08,0:39:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do me a favor...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.53,0:39:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And count this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.74,0:39:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我咋不早这么干呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}why didn't I do that earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.57,0:39:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}1...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.63,0:39:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}...3...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.54,0:39:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.81,0:39:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四  五\N{\fnArial\fs30}...4...5.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.23,0:39:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.69,0:39:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.64,0:40:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.54,0:40:25.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬那个迷你的地方检察官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to the tiniest D.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.24,0:40:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢他撤销了控诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for dropping the charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.26,0:40:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人小权大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little big man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.38,0:40:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.87,0:40:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.43,0:40:42.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们那些魔法真的能找回\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think lucky charms really could have, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.42,0:40:43.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Returned soul to sender?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.26,0:40:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.44,0:40:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crazy to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.37,0:40:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他说得挺像那么回事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did talk a good game, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.58,0:40:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.47,0:40:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.87,0:40:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.79,0:41:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交易从来都没有好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's a deal ever been a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.44,0:41:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想知道他有什么办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to figure out how it works in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.47,0:41:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我的脑子还在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I-I do still have all my brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.59,0:41:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要说有什么区别的话  我脑子现在更好使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything, my brain works better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.41,0:41:16.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想确定下你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just making sure that's where your head's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.87,0:41:18.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确定下你是否犹豫过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that you're not having second thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.33,0:41:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要拿回你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}About getting your soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.79,0:41:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没犹豫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.98,0:41:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
